SUMMARY:Fairview Christmas Festival\, Tinsel Tree Trail and Parade
LOCATION:Fairview Town Park\, Fairview\, AL
DESCRIPTION:Fairview's holiday day includes an all ages fun run and a 5K 
 earlier in the day\, then an evening festival with caroling at 5 p.m. and
  a parade with floats\, the marching band and Santa. The new Tinsel Tree 
 Trail at the town park features trees decorated by local families and bus
 inesses. Time: Festival and caroling 5:00 PM\; parade follows. https://ww
 w.cullmantribune.com/2026/11/13/fairview-seeks-tree-sponsors-for-tinsel-t
 ree-trail-at-town-park/
